    ("v366_mmst_seam_collar", "SEAM.MMST.INCLASS.01 (Direction 7): the seam collar is IN MMST's free-lattice-fermion scaling-limit class, so the chiral scaling limit is a chiral CFT of central charge 8 pinned to (E8)_1 -- reducing SEAM.EQUIV.01 to the single S3 lattice-realisation input. Osborne-Stottmeister (arXiv:2107.13834, CMP 398 (2023); legacy internal token MMST, on the MMST/Morinelli-Morsella-Stottmeister-Tanimoto OAR framework): free lattice fermions (CAR quasi-free) -> chiral-CFT massless scaling limit with correct c, range rank<=c<=D. [E] CLASS ARITHMETIC/RANGE: D=dim S^+=2^(g_car-1)=16 Majoranas, c=g_car+N_fam=8, rank E8=8 => rank<=c<=D is 8<=8<=16 IN range. [E] GAPPED (derived): Delta=6 ln(3/2)>0 (v302). [C] QUASI-FREE CAR class (v155/v160). [E] CHIRALITY: c_-=D/2=8 != 0 (non-gappable anomalous edge, v356 S4). [C] MMST SCALING LIMIT applies (in-class & gapped & chiral & in-range) => chiral CFT c=8 (v336). [E] TARGET PINNED TO (E8)_1: c=8 + order-4 mu4 clock select E8 (det K=1, one primary) over SO(16)_1 (det K=4) -- v351. [O] RESIDUAL S3: the one open input = the collar realised as a genuine LATTICE chiral free-fermion invertible phase (one-sidedness/Flat-Away, v297/v356 S3) = the seam one-sidedness that defines c3; given S3, MMST applies as a cited theorem. ADVANCES SEAM.EQUIV.01 (verifies MMST in-class), does not close it. Python-only (sympy)."),
    ("v370_grav_spin2_unitarity", "GRAV.SPIN2.UNITARITY.01 (Track 2): the Barnes-Rivers spin decomposition of the graviton propagator -- perturbative graviton unitarity SECTOR-BY-SECTOR. EXTENDS v304 (scalar pole algebra) to the tensor spin structure and combines it with v334 (spin-0 conformal mode). [E] PROJECTOR COMPLETENESS: tr P2=(d-2)(d+1)/2, tr P1=d-1, tr P0s=tr P0w=1 sum to d(d+1)/2; in d=4 the split is 5+3+1+1=10. [E] EH STRUCTURE: spin-2 coefficient +1, spin-0 scalar -1/(d-2)=-1/2. [E] STELLE GHOST IS SPIN-2: a local R+R^2 dressing 1+p^2/M^2 puts the negative-residue ghost pole at p^2=-M^2 in the SPIN-2 sector. [E] ENTIRE FORM FACTOR => SPIN-2 GHOST-FREE: a(p^2)=e^{p^2/M^2} (v304/v259) keeps the spin-2 propagator's only pole at p^2=0. [C] SPIN-0 VIA GHP: the wrong-sign conformal mode (c_conf(4)=-3/2, v332) is cured by the GHP contour (v334) -- a different mechanism. [C] PERTURBATIVE UNITARITY sector-by-sector (spin-2 entire form factor + spin-0 GHP), conditional on v304's entire-analyticity assumption. [O] residual: perturbative-only + the open analyticity assumption; NOT the non-perturbative measure (QG.AMB.01). [O] DECLINE: tr P2=5 is dimension counting, NOT g_car (v354/v355). Python-only (sympy)."),
    ("v367_seam_s3_lattice", "SEAM.S3.LATTICE.01 (Track 1): the EXPLICIT lattice realisation of the S3 input -- a concrete gapped chiral-Majorana (p+ip) lattice model whose edge is the 16-Majorana SO(16)_1 carrier, mu4-condensed to (E8)_1. Turns the abstract S3 residual (v356/v366) into a RUNNABLE model with a numerically-computed topological invariant. [E] BULK GAPPED: h(k)=sin kx sx + sin ky sy + (M-cos kx-cos ky) sz at M=1 has gap 2>0. [E] NON-TRIVIAL CHERN (numerical Fukui-Hatsugai-Suzuki): |C|=1 at M=1, C=0 at M=3 (trivial neg control). [E] c_-=8: each chiral Majorana edge carries c_-=C/2=1/2; N_Maj=dim S^+=16 copies => c_-=16/2=8=g_car+N_fam. [E] EDGE K-MATRIX: the 16-Majorana edge is SO(16)_1 (det D8=4) condensed to (E8)_1 (det E8=1) by the order-4 mu4 clock (v351/v369). [C] mu4 condensation SO(16)_1 -> (E8)_1 (v154/v351). [O] residual: the continuum SCALING-LIMIT existence (MMST v336) stays open; S3 is now a concrete lattice model, reduced not closed. Python (numpy Chern + sympy Cartan dets)."),
    ("v368_seam_s3_inflow", "SEAM.S3.INFLOW.01 (Track 1): the bulk-edge / anomaly-inflow leg (S4 of the v356 chain) made CONCRETE on the v367 lattice model -- a finite STRIP of the gapped p+ip model has a realised, non-gappable chiral edge, so edge EXISTENCE follows from the invertible bulk (anomaly inflow), NOT a separate assumption. [E] TOPO IN-GAP EDGE STATES: M=1 strip reaches min_kx|E|~0 (a chiral branch traverses the gap); [E] TRIVIAL CLEAN GAP: M=3 strip min_kx|E|>0.3 (neg control). [E] EDGE-LOCALISED: the near-zero state's weight is concentrated within 4 sites of a boundary (edge>>bulk). [E] BULK-EDGE CORRESPONDENCE: edge branch count = bulk Chern |C|=1 => 16-Majorana edge, c_-=8. [C] ANOMALY INFLOW: a c_-!=0 invertible bulk cannot have a gappable edge, so the chiral edge of the collar EXISTS as a consequence of the bulk -- discharges the v336/v351 'does the edge exist?' residual on the lattice. [O] residual: the continuum scaling limit (MMST v336) stays open. Python (numpy)."),
